ind":"announcement","title":"Wishlist During Steam Next Fest","summary":"Leviathan: Rhino is part of Steam Next Fest (October 19-26), and the demo is live right now. The demo will stay up for the whole fest and for one more week after it. Then we'll switch it off before the full release on November 6. Wishlist during Next Fest If the demo stays with you, please add Leviathan: Rhino to your wishlist. Wishlists during Next Fest help Steam show the game to more players at launch - and you'll get a notification the moment it's out on November 6. https://store.steampowere","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:54:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691963","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4784510-1846651706690430","game_id":"steam-4784510","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is out now","summary":"The Leviathan: Rhino demo is now live on Steam as part of Steam Next Fest (October 19-26). A giant leviathan is walking toward a small village. Almost everyone has left. One old man stays - his whole life and all his memories are here. You spend his last days with him as the creature gets closer. What's in the demo Your first look at the village and the people who still live in it The first characters you'll meet - and the old man at the center of it all The opening of the story The demo takes a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:11:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4784510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last